# Bot2's Ancestral Recall targets Bot1, whose own Chains of Mephistopheles replaces each draw with a discard. The discard is the
# replacement effect's, so an ability Bot1 controls causes it (CR 614.1a, 609.1), not Bot2's spell: the Wilt-Leaf Liege
# Bot1 discards this way goes to its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Swamp
Chains of Mephistopheles
Wilt-Leaf Liege
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ancestral Recall
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Chains of Mephistopheles.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Choose(Wilt-Leaf Liege)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Chains of Mephistopheles; Mox Jet; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp; Swamp; Wilt-Leaf Liege
